  "description": "Raspberry Pi cameras for Shiny.AppDeviceBridge: a binding to libcamera through a small C shim (native/shinyrpi-camera) — frames from the capture pipeline with no rpicam-apps process to launch — and a bridge serving cameras, JPEG snapshots, captures into a file root, sensor controls and a shared live MJPEG stream. Plain net11.0 with no MAUI, so it runs on a headless Pi. Requires libshinyrpi_camera.so built against the device's libcamera. One call: bridge.AddRpiCameraBridge().",
